{"seq":3,"slug":"simd-operator-tuning-fallback","title":"SIMD 算子调优、标量回退与正确性验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/column-operators-simd/simd-operator-tuning-fallback","wordCount":2936,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"simd-算子调优-标量回退与正确性验证\">SIMD 算子调优、标量回退与正确性验证</h1><p>向量化引擎里，写一条 <code>_mm256_cmpgt_epi32</code> 只是开始。真正决定线上 P99 的是三件不那么显眼的事：批大小不整除 SIMD 宽度时尾部怎么办、CPU 没有 AVX-512 时降级到哪一层、以及降级路径与向量路径产生不同结果时谁先发现。本文把「回退」当作一等公民——它是算子契约的一部分。承接 <a href=\"simd-selection-vector-model\">SIMD 通路与选择向量</a> 的数据通路，这一篇讲通路在真实硬件上如何被调、被降级、被验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三条调优轴向与一条回退契约\">核心概念：三条调优轴向与一条回退契约</h2><p>SIMD 算子的调优空间可以被压缩成三条互相拉扯的轴向，任何一条失控都会把收益吃回去。</p>\n<p><strong>第一条是尾部（tail）。</strong> 批大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与向量宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 通常不整除。设一次向量指令成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、一次标量步成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 行的成本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>W</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(n) = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{n}{W} \\right\\rfloor c_v + (n \\bmod W)\\, c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\bmod W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的比例上升，标量尾部主导整体成本。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>（AVX-512，<code>int32</code>）时最坏是 15 行标量尾巴，摊薄后收益趋零。</p>\n<p><strong>第二条是分派广度。</strong> 一份二进制要同时跑在 Zen 4、Sapphire Rapids 与五年前的老 Xeon 上，就必须带多条实现并在运行时选择。层数越多可移植性越强，但构建时间、ICache 占用与验证面积同步膨胀——每一层都是一份需要被证明正确的新代码。</p>\n<p><strong>第三条是选择性阈值。</strong> 有些 SIMD 形态在低选择性下极快、在高选择性下反而慢于朴素标量循环。典型是 gather：当选择向量稀疏到一定程度，逐行读取比一条 gather 指令搬移整个向量更省带宽。此时「主动回退到标量」是正确决策。</p>\n<p>三条轴向共同受一条<strong>回退契约</strong>约束：任何 SIMD 路径都必须存在一份语义等价的标量参考实现；分派只能改变性能，不能改变结果；回退的触发条件必须可观测。Intel 的《Intel 64 and IA-32 Architectures Optimization Reference Manual》把这类「标量参照 + 向量实现」配对列为内层循环优化的标准做法，原因与数据库引擎的实践一致：向量代码的错误往往不是崩溃，而是静默地返回错一个 bit 的结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[算子调用&lt;br/&gt;VectorBatch 输入] --&gt; B{批大小 n&lt;br/&gt;是否整除 W}&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C[纯向量主循环]&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; D[满向量主循环&lt;br/&gt;加尾部处理]&#10;  D --&gt; E{尾部策略}&#10;  E -- 掩码加载 --&gt; F[maskz_loadu&lt;br/&gt;单指令吞尾]&#10;  E -- 标量循环 --&gt; G[逐行标量尾部&lt;br/&gt;成本 n mod W]&#10;  C --&gt; H{运行时分派}&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H -- AVX-512 --&gt; I[compressstoreu 路径]&#10;  H -- AVX2 --&gt; J[movemask + tzcnt 路径]&#10;  H -- 无 SIMD --&gt; K[标量参考实现&lt;br/&gt;正确性 oracle]&#10;  I --&gt; L[结果向量]&#10;  J --&gt; L&#10;  K --&gt; L\">flowchart TD\n  A[算子调用&lt;br/&gt;VectorBatch 输入] --&gt; B{批大小 n&lt;br/&gt;是否整除 W}\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C[纯向量主循环]\n  B -- 否 --&gt; D[满向量主循环&lt;br/&gt;加尾部处理]\n  D --&gt; E{尾部策略}\n  E -- 掩码加载 --&gt; F[maskz_loadu&lt;br/&gt;单指令吞尾]\n  E -- 标量循环 --&gt; G[逐行标量尾部&lt;br/&gt;成本 n mod W]\n  C --&gt; H{运行时分派}\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H -- AVX-512 --&gt; I[compressstoreu 路径]\n  H -- AVX2 --&gt; J[movemask + tzcnt 路径]\n  H -- 无 SIMD --&gt; K[标量参考实现&lt;br/&gt;正确性 oracle]\n  I --&gt; L[结果向量]\n  J --&gt; L\n  K --&gt; L</pre><p>流程里最值得注意的边是最后一条：<strong>标量实现同时扮演生产回退与测试 oracle 两个角色</strong>。一份代码承担两个目的，是这套设计最经济的取舍——它让「回退路径有没有被测试覆盖」自动获得肯定答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尾部与掩码-让回退不破坏向量化收益\">尾部与掩码：让回退不破坏向量化收益</h2><p>尾部处理有三种主流写法，代价与风险差异明显。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>尾部策略</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>补齐缓冲区</td>\n<td>复制到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 整数倍长度，填中性值</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le W-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 行拷贝</td>\n<td>填充值须对谓词中性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掩码加载</td>\n<td><code>_mm512_maskz_loadu_epi32</code>；AVX2 <code>_mm256_maskload_epi32</code>（仅 32/64 位）</td>\n<td>一条指令，无拷贝</td>\n<td>未选 lane 须清零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标量尾部循环</td>\n<td>满向量后逐行处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\bmod W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 行</td>\n<td>最多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次标量步</td>\n<td>最易写也最慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>掩码加载最优雅但有硬件门槛：AVX2 的 <code>maskload</code> 家族<strong>只支持 32/64 位整数及浮点</strong>，不支持 <code>int8</code>/<code>int16</code>——这正是很多引擎在窄整数列上退回标量尾部的原因（指令语义见 Intel Intrinsics Guide，<code>https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/docs/intrinsics-guide/index.html</code>）。</p>\n<p>尾部策略还必须与<strong>掩码语义</strong>对齐。做 <code>SUM</code> 时未选 lane 置 0 中性；做 <code>MIN</code>/<code>MAX</code> 时填 0 会污染结果，应填 <code>INT_MAX</code> / <code>INT_MIN</code>。填充值依赖算子的代数性质，不是一张常量表能覆盖的。</p>\n<p>更稳健的做法是<strong>尾部只在批级别处理，不在算子内部处理</strong>。切片算子（DuckDB 的 <code>Vector::Slice</code>）负责归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，过滤算子产出的选择向量天然携带真实长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，下游按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 处理即可。这与 <a href=\"../execution-model-evolution/push-vectorized-execution\">向量化推送执行</a> 的批边界设计相关——批边界稳定，尾部成本才可预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运行时分派-回退阶梯与多版本函数\">运行时分派：回退阶梯与多版本函数</h2><p>分派阶梯的现实形态通常长这样：AVX-512 → AVX2 → SSE4.2 → 标量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型检测位</th>\n<th>主要增益</th>\n<th>回退触发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AVX-512F/BW</td>\n<td>CPUID leaf 7, EBX bit 16/30</td>\n<td>k 掩码、<code>compressstoreu</code>、掩码加载</td>\n<td>老 Xeon、Zen 3 及更早</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AVX2</td>\n<td>CPUID leaf 7, EBX bit 5</td>\n<td>32 位整数 8 lane、<code>movemask</code></td>\n<td>2013 年前的 x86-64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSE4.2</td>\n<td>CPUID leaf 1, ECX bit 20</td>\n<td>4 lane，基线保障</td>\n<td>极旧平台、部分虚拟化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标量</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>正确性参照</td>\n<td>非 x86、强制诊断模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现分派有两条路。<strong>手工分派</strong>用 <code>__builtin_cpu_supports</code> 或 <code>cpuid</code> 在算子入口查表取函数指针——控制粒度最细，能按算子决定是否值得走 AVX-512（窄整数比较收益大、字符串操作收益小）。<strong>编译期多版本</strong>用 GCC/Clang 的 <code>__attribute__((target_clones(&quot;avx512f&quot;,&quot;avx2&quot;,&quot;default&quot;)))</code>，让编译器自动生成多份实现并借 IFUNC 在加载期选择——代码量最小，但「哪份实现对哪个算子生效」的可见性最差。</p>\n<p>选哪条路取决于回退的可观测性要求。手工分派可在每次进入回退时递增计数器；<code>target_clones</code> 完全隐式，一旦某算子因成本模型判定「不值得向量化」而静默用 default，剖析里只能看到「这个算子慢」，看不到「它根本没向量化」。AVX-512 还有一个分派层之外的因素：<strong>频率行为</strong>。Sapphire Rapids 之前的某些服务器 CPU 在 512 位重负载下会降频，使 AVX-512 版本在混合负载上跑不过 AVX2。决策依据应来自目标平台实测，而非指令宽度本身——Agner Fog 的指令延迟/吞吐表（<code>https://www.agner.org/optimize/</code>）提供逐个指令的微架构数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gather-与选择性-何时主动放弃-simd\">Gather 与选择性：何时主动放弃 SIMD</h2><p>选择向量驱动的 gather 是最容易被误用的 SIMD 形态。每条 gather 指令要触达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条不同的 cache line——访存的<strong>随机性</strong>而非字节量决定成本。</p>\n<p>AVX2 的 <code>_mm256_i32gather_epi32</code> 在多数微架构上是微码实现，逐 lane 分解，吞吐远低于等价数量的顺序加载。结论反直觉：<strong>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 很低时，标量逐行读 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个值往往快于 gather 整个向量</strong>——标量只触碰真正需要的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条 cache line，gather 仍要处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 个 lane 的槽位。</p>\n<p>据此可估阈值：设顺序加载每 lane 成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、gather 每 lane 成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_G &gt; c_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），按批 gather 的每结果元素成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_G \\cdot \\frac{W}{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，标量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。令两者相等得</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{k}{n} \\approx \\frac{k}{W} \\cdot \\frac{c_G}{c_L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上只需在算子内做<strong>两路实现的比例分派</strong>：选择率高于经验阈值走 gather，低于则走标量回退。阈值随微架构变化，因此是配置项而非编译期常量。</p>\n<p>一个更彻底的规避手段是<strong>改变算法而非调参</strong>：把「按选择向量 gather 宽列」换成「谓词下推到扫描阶段、只物化必要列」，即 <a href=\"simd-selection-vector-model\">SIMD 通路与选择向量</a> 提到的延迟物化。Abadi 等人（ICDE 2007，《Materialization Strategies in a Column-Oriented DBMS》）的量化结论是：推迟物化在大宽表扫描上能减少数倍 I/O 与解压开销——比任何 gather 微调都高一个数量级。SIMD 调优的天花板通常不是指令，而是算法是否给了向量化一个合适的问题形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正确性验证-差分测试与语义陷阱\">正确性验证：差分测试与语义陷阱</h2><p>向量路径的错误极少是崩溃，多数是<strong>边界条件下的错值</strong>。以下五类陷阱反复出现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>诱因</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NaN 比较方向</td>\n<td>标量 <code>&gt;</code> 对 NaN 返回 false，SIMD 无序谓词依指令变体而异</td>\n<td>显式用 ordered 谓词（如 <code>_CMP_GT_OQ</code>）并单测 NaN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有符号溢出</td>\n<td>向量化 <code>SUM</code> 中间累加溢出是 UB，编译器可任意优化</td>\n<td>用宽累加器或定义回绕语义，UBSan 开 <code>-fsanitize=signed-integer-overflow</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移位越界</td>\n<td>标量 <code>x &lt;&lt; 32</code> 是 UB，向量指令逐 lane 独立</td>\n<td>显式 mask 移位量，或前置分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NULL 三值逻辑</td>\n<td>向量路径把 NULL 折叠为 false</td>\n<td>保持 validity 位图与选择向量正交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-0.0</code> 与 <code>+0.0</code></td>\n<td>比较相等但位模式不同，影响 <code>DISTINCT</code>、哈希、序列化</td>\n<td>区分「位相等」与「值相等」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>防御这些陷阱的标准武器是<strong>差分测试（differential testing）</strong>：同一份输入同时喂给 SIMD 实现与标量参考实现，逐元素比对输出。当输入空间无法穷举，就用带 SQL 语义感知的模糊器自动生成查询——ETH Zürich 的 SQLancer（Rigger &amp; Su，<code>https://github.com/sqlancer/sqlancer</code>）正是为「让 DBMS 自己暴露逻辑不一致」而设计。它寻找的「同一查询的不同执行路径给出不同答案」，与向量路径和标量路径这对分歧源天然契合。</p>\n<p>验证的覆盖重点应放在 SIMD 特有的边界而非通用随机输入：批大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\in \\{W-1, W, W+1, 2W-1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 的尾部行为、选择向量长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\in \\{0, 1, n-1, n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 的退化情形、全 NULL 列与常数列参与运算的组合。这些点规模小，却能覆盖绝大多数错值缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性-别让回退静默生效\">可观测性：别让回退静默生效</h2><p>回退最大的工程风险不是「慢」，而是<strong>你不知道它发生了</strong>。只在支持 AVX-512 的开发机上验证过的算子，到生产降级到 AVX2 后可能因尾部策略不同而结果分裂——没有指标区分路径，排查就从「定位问题」退化为「猜」。</p>\n<p>可落地的做法有三层。<strong>计数器</strong>：每个分派点记录进入各层的次数并暴露为运行时统计；生产 AVX-512 计数为零而开发机非零，差异立刻可见。<strong>强制模式</strong>：提供设置项强制走标量路径用于 A/B——若强制标量后结果变化，说明向量路径有缺陷；若结果不变而变慢某倍，该倍数就是向量化的真实增益。<strong>双路径基准</strong>：把两条路径的延迟一起纳入 CI，让向量路径退化为标量速度在合并前暴露。</p>\n<p>三点合起来回答一个具体问题：当有人报告「这个查询比上周慢了三倍」，你能否在五分钟内区分是数据分布变了、回退被触发了、还是向量路径本身退化了。若答案是否定的，可维护性上限已被回退的不可观测性锁死——此时补指标比继续优化指令更有价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SIMD 调优有三条互相拉扯的轴向：尾部处理（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(n)=\\lfloor n/W\\rfloor c_v + (n \\bmod W)c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、分派广度、选择性阈值；三者受一条回退契约约束——分派只改性能，不改结果。</li>\n<li>尾部策略按成本排序：补齐缓冲区 &lt; 掩码加载 &lt; 标量循环；AVX2 的 <code>maskload</code> 不支持 8/16 位整数，这是窄整数列常退回标量尾部的硬件原因。</li>\n<li>分派阶梯为 AVX-512 → AVX2 → SSE4.2 → 标量。手工分派可观测性好，<code>target_clones</code> 代码量小但枚举性差；AVX-512 的选择还应纳入频率行为。</li>\n<li>Gather 在高选择性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 低）时慢于标量逐行读取，成本由访问的 cache line 数而非字节量决定；比调阈值更有效的是延迟物化这类算法级手段。</li>\n<li>向量路径的错误以错值为主，集中在 NaN 比较方向、有符号溢出、移位越界、NULL 三值逻辑、<code>-0.0</code>/<code>+0.0</code> 五类；差分测试与 SQLancer 式模糊器是主要防线。</li>\n<li>回退必须可观测：分派计数器、强制标量模式、双路径 CI 基准，三者决定这套实现在线上是否可维护。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SIMD 算子调优、标量回退与正确性验证","id":"simd-算子调优-标量回退与正确性验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三条调优轴向与一条回退契约","id":"核心概念-三条调优轴向与一条回退契约"},{"level":2,"text":"尾部与掩码：让回退不破坏向量化收益","id":"尾部与掩码-让回退不破坏向量化收益"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时分派：回退阶梯与多版本函数","id":"运行时分派-回退阶梯与多版本函数"},{"level":2,"text":"Gather 与选择性：何时主动放弃 SIMD","id":"gather-与选择性-何时主动放弃-simd"},{"level":2,"text":"正确性验证：差分测试与语义陷阱","id":"正确性验证-差分测试与语义陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性：别让回退静默生效","id":"可观测性-别让回退静默生效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"向量化 filter、聚合与 hash join 算子实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/column-operators-simd/vectorized-operator-implementation"},"next":{"title":"列式内存布局、编码与空值位图：向量化执行的物理基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/columnar-memory-layout-encoding"}}